### Configuración de Token para Rutas Protegidas (ADMIN)
@admin_token = rellenar_con_token_jwt_admin

### Create autor - success (201, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/autores
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "nacionalidad": "Colombiana"
}

### List autores - default pagination (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores

### List autores - custom pagination (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores?page=1&size=10

### Get autor by id - success (200, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores/1
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

### Get autor by id - not found (404, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores/999
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

### Update autor - success (200, ADMIN)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/autores/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nacionalidad": "Colombiana/Mexicana"
}

### Update autor - not found (404, ADMIN)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/autores/999
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Inexistente"
}

### Get libros by autor - success (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores/1/libros?page=1&size=10

### Get libros by autor - not found (404, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/autores/999/libros
